Rule 10 (tensor must have valid dimensions for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) ≠ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ i ∧ i < ndim(v_1) ∧ shape(v_1, i) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 13 (tensor must have compatible dimensions with other tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) ≠ 0 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) ≠ 0
